  replay. Entries are mean $\pm$ sample standard deviation of finite
  per-replay angular scores, in degrees. $n$ is the number of valid directed
  scores out of ten executions; availability is reported separately.}
  \label{tab:direction-ou3-rms}
  \footnotesize
  \setlength{\tabcolsep}{3.0pt}
  \renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.06}
  \begin{tabular}{@{}lrrrr@{}}
