    JONSWAP     & 0.27 & $38.44\pm3.47$ & -- & 0 \\
    JONSWAP     & 1.50 & $24.00\pm1.85$ & $18.93\pm0.66$ & 10 \\
    JONSWAP     & 4.00 & $21.19\pm2.89$ & $18.96\pm2.02$ & 10 \\
